  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": "\"put\": the senses *write* (*put your name here*) and *say* (*put it another way*) use a verb of writing or speaking in many languages, not a verb of placing.",
    "grammar": "\"put\": in the sense *move something to a place*, the verb needs both an object and a place (*put it on the table*); many languages let the place be left out. The present, past, and past participle are all **put**.",
